Deep Learning Methods in Genome Assembly Post-processing (Categorized by Function)
1. Polishing (Error Correction)
PEPPER–Margin–DeepVariant
•	Method: CNN + RNN (LSTM) + Attention
•	PEPPER: Uses CNN/RNN to generate candidate bases from ONT raw signals
•	Margin: Performs phasing using an RNN-based Hidden Markov Model (HMM)
•	DeepVariant: A CNN classifier designed by Google, treating reads pileup as “images” for base prediction
NextPolish / NextPolish2
•	Method: Candidate base scoring model based on neural networks (includes deep learning filtering module)
•	Note: The DL module is mainly used for error pattern recognition and iterative correction strategies (non-traditional CNN/RNN)
DeepConsensus
•	Method: Transformer / Attention Network
•	Description: PacBio official tool, learns sequencing error patterns from subreads using attention models to generate high-accuracy CCS sequences
Apollo
•	Method: CNN + Transformer
•	Extracts features from pileup for base prediction and structural error detection
DeepPolisher
•	Method: CNN
•	Uses reads pileup as input, treats local sequences as 2D matrices for per-base correction
________________________________________
2. Basecalling (Critical Step Affecting Post-processing)
Dorado
•	Method: Transformer
•	ONT’s latest basecaller, improves accuracy from signal to bases
Bonito
•	Method: CTC + CNN/RNN
•	Uses convolution + bidirectional RNN (GRU/LSTM) for signal modeling
Chiron
•	Method: CNN + RNN + CTC
•	One of the earliest end-to-end deep learning basecallers, using 5 layers of CNN+RNN to parse raw signal
________________________________________
3. Gap Closing (Filling Missing Regions)
GAPpredict
•	Method: LSTM
•	Predicts missing sequences based on sequences flanking the gap
DLGapcloser
•	Method: BiLSTM + homologous sequence mapping network
•	Uses homology-based sequence alignment information + deep learning to predict gap sequences
DL-GapFilling
•	Method: CNN + BiLSTM + BSCEA + homologous sequence mapping network
•	Combines CNN and BiLSTM with BSCEA prediction algorithm to predict gap sequences
•	Applies PredictionFilter to further improve accuracy
________________________________________
4. Haplotype Phasing
DeepTrio
•	Method: CNN (trio version of DeepVariant)
•	Uses parent–child trio data for phasing prediction, improving phased accuracy
________________________________________
5. Contamination Removal
DeepMicrobes
•	Method: CNN + Attention
•	Performs microbial classification of reads, directly predicting contaminant sources using deep learning
________________________________________
6. Integrated Assembly + Post-processing (Including Deep Learning Modules)
Verkko2
•	Method: Includes optional deep learning-assisted modules (e.g., DeepPolisher / DeepVariant pipeline)
•	Performs end-to-end assembly, gap filling, and phasing
•	Key advantage: integrates graph algorithms with deep learning polishing

